{{also|Appendix:Variations of "po"}}
==Macedonian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/pɔ/|lang=mk}}

===Prefix===
{{head|mk|prefix}}

# A prefix indicating the delimitative aspect.
#: ''спие'' — ''to sleep''
#: ''поспие'' — ''to have some sleep, sleep a little''
# A prefix indicating the perfective aspect.
#: ''влече'' — ''to pull'' (''impf.'')
#: ''повлече'' — ''to pull, give a tug'' (''pf.'')
# A comparative prefix in adjectives and adverbs.
#: ''ефтин'' — ''cheap''
#: ''поефтин'' — ''cheaper''
#:: ''често'' — ''often''
#:: ''почесто'' — ''more often''

